  "description": "Some signals are saying to EXIT NOW",
  "body_html": "<p>We have been largely out of the market for about a month and a half now. A few small positions along the way, some decent wins, like Bright Springs Health and Global Star. A few losses as well, like Airship AI and CVR Energy. Overall, October and the first half of November have turned into nothing burgers. Unfortunately, I wish I could tell you the “dip” is over, but I cannot. </p><p>The VIX is &gt;22, this is a HARD STOP for me personally. S&amp;P 500 futures printed a short signal. Maybe it reverses today. Maybe next week. Maybe next year. Who know?! What I do know, is that all big crashes are preceded by small crashes. So by keeping losses small, the primary goal is to not lose all the wins we have had through 2025.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P_qo!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F41bc5912-8356-4c14-ac1b-b94d56348da4_1167x770.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P_qo!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F41bc5912-8356-4c14-ac1b-b94d56348da4_1167x770.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P_qo!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F41bc5912-8356-4c14-ac1b-b94d56348da4_1167x770.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P_qo!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F41bc5912-8356-4c14-ac1b-b94d56348da4_1167x770.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P_qo!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F41bc5912-8356-4c14-ac1b-b94d56348da4_1167x770.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P_qo!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F41bc5912-8356-4c14-ac1b-b94d56348da4_1167x770.png\" width=\"1167\" height=\"770\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/41bc5912-8356-4c14-ac1b-b94d56348da4_1167x770.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:770,&quot;width&quot;:1167,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:149842,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/178884359?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F41bc5912-8356-4c14-ac1b-b94d56348da4_1167x770.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P_qo!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F41bc5912-8356-4c14-ac1b-b94d56348da4_1167x770.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P_qo!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F41bc5912-8356-4c14-ac1b-b94d56348da4_1167x770.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P_qo!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F41bc5912-8356-4c14-ac1b-b94d56348da4_1167x770.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P_qo!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F41bc5912-8356-4c14-ac1b-b94d56348da4_1167x770.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">My self built indicator is not perfect…but it is accurate far more often than it is wrong. </figcaption></figure></div><p> You are welcome to my <a href=\"https://www.tradingview.com/script/YkJaCmZq-StockTok-Trend-Indicator/\">StockTok Trend indicator</a> if you would like to add it to your charts. Just click the link, add to favorites, and then add to your chart</p><p><strong>POV: I will be cutting my few remaining positions, except the NVDA short which is sprinting into profit. Unless a miracle occurs today…unlikely…I will just be trying to save any percent I can for the few positions.</strong></p><p>I wish I had better news, but unfortunately, markets go up, and markets go down. I have 2 primary goals as a Substack creator for you:</p><ol><li><p>Make money.</p></li><li><p>Protect money. We have been in the “protect money” phase a lot. We want to ensure that when the markets do return….and they will at some point… that we have enough capital to actually play again. The October dip buyers have been absolutely devastated. We shall not join them. </p></li></ol><p>Please watch the video to the end. If you like the content, give it a like 🛑 and a re-stack. Sorry to ask, have to play the social media game. Comments or questions are also welcome down below, or in the main chat. </p><h4>Some stock market highlights from this week, in case you missed anything:</h4><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-on-my-radar-to-buy?r=4z8lgl\">Stock on my radar to buy.</a> If we get a major reversal, this will come back into play, similar to our winning GSAT postion.</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/time-to-short-nvidia-again?r=4z8lgl\">Time to short Nvidia, again?</a> We were waiting for trend to break. It broke.</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/shorting-nvidia?r=4z8lgl\">Shorting Nvidia</a></p></li></ul><p>As always, if you have questions, I am available in the main chat during market hours. Don’t hesitate to ask. The only bad question is the one not asked…DON’T BE SHY! We have an awesome crew in there. Hope you all have a great weekend!</p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok Main Page</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Positions</a> |</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Reserources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-9809